comments[19]:
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T09:24:18.862Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Duplicate check: live GH-1364 search across all statuses returned zero; pm-szn67i is closed for earlier strict-close/global scope corrections. Reuse recovery-closure lineage pm-f05lsg. GitHub issue remains the external owner; local implementation only."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T09:44:09.288Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Current-main negative control: exact retry from two colliding trackers reads the default tracker and drops JSON and valid close_reason. New executable retry regression fails on untouched 89b4aa8bb; fixed branch passes with selected tracker, JSON, valid selectors, aliases, attached values and spaces. Expanded focused suite passed 58/58. Full coverage/static/package checks remain underway; no publishing authorized."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T15:01:58.882Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final packed CLI exact recovery replay passed selected colliding tracker, JSON and retained valid fields. Final source coverage runner exited 0: 9467 passed, two Windows-only skips, zero uncovered counts in all four dimensions. Generated changelog consistency and post-close graph/history/tracker assurance pass; hosted checks and PR review remain pending."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T15:32:45.273Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: Hosted Windows regression exposed a POSIX path literal in the new refusal fixture. Expected scope now uses platform path.join; exact argv and unsafe-scope negative control are unchanged. Added structured gate evidence required by the post-close defect gate. Prior static success preceded closure and did not validate this terminal-only requirement; final checks are rerunning.
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T17:59:46.045Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Recovery review corrections pass focused CLI/SDK replay tests, lint and all four type checks: legacy/canonical tracker flags consume flag-looking values including literal --, selected full/brief/compact survives generic suggestions, and supported root --explain remains intact before/after the command. Actual CLI already normalizes both token_budget forms before recovery; scanner now also canonicalizes declared aliases defensively. No merge or live telemetry transmission performed."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T18:31:00.168Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Full-source linked run on dd42b1f3c recorded a failed receipt: 9472 passed, 12 failed, two skipped. One failure was the introduced 121-file SDK test directory; eleven were fixture behavior changed by inherited global telemetry opt-outs. No live telemetry was sent. Corrected directory grouping plus a process-only network namespace (loopback available, no external route; original host settings and queues untouched) now pass all 138 affected tests without weakening assertions. Full coverage will rerun under this containment; previous failed metrics are not passing evidence."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T18:55:48.713Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Review correction: failed run test-local-mupv1k68-926ate now carries no measurements. Its four provisional 100-percent values were invalid because the coverage gate failed; the original failed receipt and immutable history remain intact. The CLI exposes no prior-receipt measurement edit, so this exact-row correction used the checked-out PM mutateItem test_run_track operation with automatic author, item locking, no force, and immutable history. Future measurements will be recorded only from an actually passing producing gate."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T18:57:02.287Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Current post-reopen recovery receipt test-local-mupwadit-o8by2n passed the existing canonical focused command (CLI selected-tracker replay, projection-retry unit cases, closed-domain discovery). This reruns the corrected source without duplicating its linked test. It covers tracker-path aliases and flag-looking values, single full/brief/compact selection, root explain and both token_budget spellings. The failed aggregate run remains failed with no measurements; full-source verification is pending."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T19:40:37.587Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Hosted static import-boundary failure corrected by removing a private bootstrap-scanner import: canonical pm-path arity and declared alias metadata now cover legacy paths, while every other option retains contract-driven arity. Current focused suite passes 77 tests, lint, all four type configurations, and the exact SDK import-boundary check has zero violations. The contained full-source attempt stopped without a final exit report or receipt and is uncompleted, not passing evidence; a supervised retry will use final source with no provisional measurements."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T20:04:32.788Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Current verification receipts: test-local-mupyio63-jdx8vs passes the exact latest four-file focused command (77 tests); test-local-mupymsom-icnh18 passes focused ESLint, all four type configurations and the exact SDK import-boundary check. Full-source producing receipt test-local-mupyg89a-2vgwyc is failed (9484 test cases passed, ten failed, two platform skips) and carries no measurements. Two failures came from read-only home npm cache writes; the same two cases now pass with an isolated writable temporary npm cache. Eight failures were timeout or load-related. All hosted checks passed on source 7bdd9a05a. Active terminal fields and unsupported exact coverage claims remain cleared; another full attempt will retain the entire corpus and every existing assertion, timeout and coverage threshold while limiting workers."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T20:35:25.475Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final-source full coverage producing receipt test-local-mupzfgkx-70we5e (pm-gh1364) passed on 09ba3c30ec10e637f111b477a46e252b4558d241: 9494 test cases passed, zero failed, two Windows-only skips; exact integer gate passed for lines 63200/63200, statements 66237/66237, functions 13710/13710 and branches 50719/50719. Its canonical passing test_runs row now carries four observed percent gates plus all covered/total dimensions and test-case counts; linked-command passed=1 remains the runner's command count. coverage-summary SHA256=40c980160ae95b9591e5cbb4ac483ee7ca5d42ee7140beb205e2c1e9f38650c6. Measurements were attached only after the actual gate passed using PM's locked test_run_track operation, automatic author and immutable history. Earlier failed receipts remain failed without measurements. This is one shared full-corpus producing receipt, referenced through real related edges by pm-gh1370 and pm-gh1371, not three separate executions. Local static/context/package aggregates and final exact-head hosted/reviewer checks remain pending. No live telemetry delivery or merge performed."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T20:47:24.816Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final canonical full static receipt test-local-muq07idm-3sj1wf failed at SDK entrypoint import-time budgets: five medians exceeded their unchanged ceilings. Earlier static stages passed, but stages after this failure did not run and this receipt is not aggregate passing evidence. Exact import-time gate is being rerun alone before deciding whether a code regression or environmental variability is responsible. Full-source coverage receipt test-local-mupzfgkx-70we5e remains passed with verified measurements; closure and merge remain held."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T20:51:53.327Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Import-time follow-up: direct default-five-sample recheck failed only graph (195 ms median versus 172 ms permitted). Canonical larger-sample receipt test-local-muq0cjcq-i81qdu failed only merge (237 ms median of 15 versus 226 ms permitted); graph cleared its unchanged ceiling. These are failed gates, not passing aggregate evidence. No budgets were changed. Remaining static stages are running separately, and a same-checkout PR-base comparison will distinguish patch-specific cost from timing variability before final closure."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T21:13:24.390Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Controlled original-checkout comparison preserved the branch and local main: PR base 89b4aa8bb and checkpoint 2916c6e2f both passed unchanged SDK import ceilings with 15 measured samples. The same ten-sample CLI transport gate failed on both: base get365>362ms, next461>440ms, create419>398ms; head get366>362ms, next451>440ms, create426>398ms. Mixed small changes do not establish a patch-specific regression; the existing local transport admission failure remains a blocker and no budget was weakened. Canonical test-local-muq0nuea-dqzwjn passes graph/record integrity plus bounded mutation (329/336 killed, seven existing equivalents); test-local-muq0up1n-tew4bo passes context relevance, unchanged artifact budget, 89 package-first commands and nine-package npx/Bunx packed smoke. Opt-in semantic dogfood and live external telemetry were unrun. The full static receipt remains failed; no all-static-passed claim is made. Current coverage/focused/type receipts remain valid for unchanged implementation source. Merge awaits final hosted/provider review, resolution of the local timing blocker and independent final-head clearance."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T21:45:09.899Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final local verification: Canonical full-source receipt test-local-mupzfgkx-70we5e passed 9494 cases with zero failures and two Windows-only skips; exact coverage lines63200/63200 statements66237/66237 functions13710/13710 branches50719/50719 is recorded on that passing producing receipt. Complete local pnpm quality:static receipt test-local-muq26sl1-rucv2t passed on CI-supported Node24.12.0 with unchanged gates. Focused/type/import-boundary receipts, context/artifact/package-first/npx-Bunx receipt test-local-muq0up1n-tew4bo and bounded mutation329/336 with seven existing equivalents pass. Node26 timing receipts remain failed; matched base/current both failed the same transport ceilings, and changing only to supported Node24 passed them. Implementation source is unchanged. Final hosted/provider review and independent merge clearance remain pending; live telemetry and opt-in semantic dogfood unrun."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T22:12:22.834Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Fresh CodeRabbit environment-default scope evidence is now explicit in the existing canonical replay test: PM_PATH selects the default tracker while cwd is outside it; the emitted retry runs unchanged and reads Default tracker, while the colliding explicit tracker and legacy/attached overrides still read Selected tracker. Canonical test-local-muq2xjyr-0neonz passes 28 recovery tests after this addition. Changed nontrivial runtime/gate helpers now have specific purpose docstrings; the provider did not identify individual missing functions. Latest CodSpeed reports decoder230.3→233.5 microseconds (-1.37%) and fingerprint+1.53%; all decoder/validation/encoding helper bodies and benchmark inputs are byte-identical to PR base. Timing noise/environment effects are an inference, not causal proof, and the current report lacks the older different-runtime warning. Fresh full coverage/static verification is pending for the separate preview repair."
    edited_at: "2026-10-01T22:48:29.873Z"
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T22:36:36.985Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Final-source static attempt test-local-muq3ukgy-ylz7yg failed at tracker-context validation: canonical reopen had cleared expected_result on two active items. Both expectations are restored through PM; gates and thresholds unchanged. Prior source stages (docstrings, exports, whole ESLint, duplicate scans, contracts, package boundaries, recovery/token gates) completed; subsequent import/transport/graph/record/mutation stages were unrun. This failed receipt carries no measurements. The recovery record is now reopened/claimed with terminal fields cleared for the post-close replay addition, so current metadata makes no final-head full-corpus or all-static passing claim. Historical producing receipts and closure events remain intact."
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T22:46:35.845Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Latest six-comment review recheck: test-local-muq46p3s-wv6uxa passes 84 affected tests, and test-local-muq4enxl-t5g2vm passes focused lint, all four type configurations and zero SDK import-boundary violations. The baseline helper now has one accurate docstring. Recovery remains reopened until fresh aggregate verification; old terminal claims are absent from current metadata. Socket setup awaits listen before entering try/finally, so the alleged cleanup masking on listen failure is not reachable and no source test edit is warranted."
    edited_at: "2026-10-01T22:48:30.415Z"
  - created_at: "2026-10-01T23:13:20.353Z"
    author: "harness:codex"
    text: "Fresh full static receipt test-local-muq4ypom-186wlk failed at the CLI transport floor: create best 564ms exceeded 398ms and claim best 596ms exceeded 415ms. Earlier static stages, tracker-context quality and SDK imports passed; later graph, record-integrity and mutation stages did not run. The failed receipt carries no measurements. Separate isolated profiling on the same source found 35-46ms mutation handlers and 327-392ms end-to-end create/claim runs, with and without linked-test source coordinates; this is diagnostic evidence, not a passing aggregate gate. Thresholds remain unchanged. Fresh full-source coverage has not yet run on the filesystem repair."
